{"page":{"id":"88aaf966-c920-4fdb-b12a-9b3c58ca7517","theme":"the-legend-of-zelda","slug":"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/zelda","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/zelda","title":"Princess Zelda","meta_title":"Princess Zelda (The Legend of Zelda) — person, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"Princess Zelda rules or protects Hyrule, often holding the Triforce of Wisdom and guiding Link against Ganon's rise. Related pages: Sheik, Hyrule, Triforce,…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        Princess of <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule\" class=\"entity-link\">Hyrule</a> and bearer of Wisdom.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/zelda/sheik\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Sheik</strong></a>, <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Hyrule</strong></a>, <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/triforce\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Triforce</strong></a>, <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/sheikah/impa\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Impa</strong></a>, <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>The Legend of Zelda</strong></a> and <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/ganon\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Ganon</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How Princess Zelda connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/zelda/sheik\" class=\"entity-link\">Sheik</a>\n            — <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/zelda/sheik\" class=\"entity-link\">Sheik</a> is Zelda&#039;s disguise.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Leads:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule\" class=\"entity-link\">Hyrule</a>\n            — Zelda is princess of <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule\" class=\"entity-link\">Hyrule</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Uses:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/triforce\" class=\"entity-link\">Triforce</a>\n            — Zelda often bears the <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/triforce\" class=\"entity-link\">Triforce</a> of Wisdom.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Supported By:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/sheikah/impa\" class=\"entity-link\">Impa</a>\n            — <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/sheikah/impa\" class=\"entity-link\">Impa</a> protects Zelda.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda\" class=\"entity-link\">The Legend of Zelda</a>\n            — <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda\" class=\"entity-link\">The Legend of Zelda</a> is connected to Princess Zelda through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/ganon\" class=\"entity-link\">Ganon</a>\n            — Princess Zelda is connected to <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/ganon\" class=\"entity-link\">Ganon</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/link\" class=\"entity-link\">Link</a>\n            — Princess Zelda is connected to <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/link\" class=\"entity-link\">Link</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\