 <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            The Legend of Zelda\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>The Legend of Zelda is connected to Princess Zelda through shared lore.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/ganon\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Ganon\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Princess Zelda is connected to Ganon through shared lore.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/link\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Link\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Princess Zelda is connected to Link through shared lore.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Leads</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Leads\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Hyrule</strong>\n                    <span>Kingdom at the hear