      </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Impa protects Zelda.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"did-you-know\">\n    <h2>Did you know?</h2>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Princess Zelda is also referenced as Hyrule&#039;s princess.</li><li>Sheik is Zelda&#039;s disguise.</li><li>Zelda is princess of Hyrule.</li><li>Zelda often bears the Triforce of Wisdom.</li><li>Impa protects Zelda.</li><li>Evidence around Princess Zelda is classified as fiction on Ton-o-Lore.</li>\n    </ul>\n</section>","overview":"<section class=\"overview\">\n    <h2>Who is Princess Zelda?</h2>\n    \n    <p>\n        Princess Zelda rules or protects <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule\" class=\"entity-link\">Hyrule</a>, often holding the <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/triforce\" class=\"entity-link\">Triforce</a> of Wisdom and guiding <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/link\" class=\"entity-link\">Link</a> against <a href=\"/the-legend-of-zelda/hyrule/ganon\" class=\"entity-link\">Ganon</a>&#039;s rise.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p class=\"also-known-as\">\n        <strong>Also known as:</strong>\n        Hyrule&#039;s princess.\n    </p>\n\n</section>","word_count":348,"uniqueness_score":"0.5950"},"entity":{"id":"2d15c0b6-4045-4210-ba48-72dabfd6aff3","name":"Princess Zelda","slug":"zelda","type":"person","kind":"character","type_label":"Character","short_description":"Princess of Hyrule and bearer of Wisdom.","description":"Princess Zelda rules or protects Hyrule, often holding the Triforce of Wisdom and guiding Link against Ganon's rise.","evidence":"fiction","universe":"the-legend-of-zelda","aliases":["Princess Zelda","Hyrule's princess"],"wikipedia_url":null,"image_url":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/zelda_gamepedia_en/images/c/c9/TotK_Princess_Zelda_Artwork.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/360?cb=20240929143055","image_source":"https://zelda.fa